# Security regression group (PLT-4645).
#
# Every line names ONE test that must exist and pass. scripts/ci/security-regression.sh runs
# them with `cargo test -p <package> <target> -- --exact <name>...` and fails when a listed
# test did not run (renamed, removed, #[ignore]d or filtered out), so a rename cannot silently
# drop coverage. Change this file in the same PR that renames or replaces a test.
#
# Format: <category> <package> <target> <test path as printed by `cargo test -- --list`>
#   category: tenant_authz | reuse_key | lease_epoch | deadline | egress_gate | resource_limits
#   target:   lib  -> `--lib`
#             test:<name> -> `--test <name>` (tests/<name>.rs)
# Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.

